WEBVTT

00:23.189 --> 00:25.190
The heart, eh?

00:25.191 --> 00:29.237
You'll find there's nothing to
be gained by targeting mine.

00:31.740 --> 00:33.616
I told you as much...

00:33.908 --> 00:37.120
You have nothing to show me.

00:39.873 --> 00:44.586
You were off target yourself,
you piece of shit pastor!

00:54.971 --> 00:59.851
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

02:19.222 --> 02:20.765
<i>My power...</i>

02:21.182 --> 02:22.933
<i>makes my body extremely flexible,</i>

02:22.934 --> 02:25.520
<i>capable of twisting further than
most people at my joints.</i>

02:25.728 --> 02:29.565
<i>One of the best aspects of that is how
the enemy generally won't notice.</i>

02:29.566 --> 02:32.025
<i>Without any change to my silhouette,</i>

02:32.026 --> 02:36.156
<i>I can twist my insides to avoid
fatal blows without any indication.</i>

02:36.531 --> 02:37.657
<i>Add to that...</i>

02:38.324 --> 02:41.451
<i>the ability to twist my skeleton
and muscles to their limits,</i>

02:41.452 --> 02:45.540
<i>in order to generate a release of energy
strong enough to shatter stone!</i>

02:46.124 --> 02:48.668
<i>Cornered Rat-Pierces the Cat!</i>

02:52.171 --> 02:54.506
<i>He's solid as hell! Not good!</i>

02:54.507 --> 02:57.426
<i>I took more damage than he did
just from the impact!</i>

02:57.427 --> 02:59.428
<i>But I need more.</i>

02:59.429 --> 03:04.641
<i>To hit closer, deeper, with my
full strength-all of my mana</i>

03:04.642 --> 03:08.186
<i>and channel the purification
straight into his soul!</i>

03:08.187 --> 03:10.940
<i>Cornered Rat-Dragon Form!</i>

03:11.482 --> 03:13.984
<i>It feels like I'm gonna puke up my guts.</i>

03:13.985 --> 03:17.196
<i>I'm running out of mana. My arms are numb.</i>

03:17.488 --> 03:19.949
<i>Stop. Just stop, already!</i>

03:20.283 --> 03:22.075
Babylon!

03:22.076 --> 03:25.455
<i>Please, let her escape!</i>

03:30.960 --> 03:32.503
Brilliant.

03:37.675 --> 03:40.720
Oh, I understand exactly
how you must feel.

03:43.848 --> 03:48.353
"Damn, what good is divine
sorcery?!" sums it up, yes?

03:49.687 --> 03:54.984
That said, there is one spell
I'm rather fond of...

03:55.610 --> 03:56.861
Luxa.

04:03.159 --> 04:06.204
Unholy Excalibur.

04:08.331 --> 04:14.003
I must say,
your body is rather interesting.

04:14.629 --> 04:18.549
Where must I strike in order to kill you?

04:27.767 --> 04:28.893
Unbelievable!

04:29.185 --> 04:32.062
The Guild isn't supposed to
be a rain shelter for you.

04:32.063 --> 04:36.901
She says that, yet she runs
around handing towels out.

04:38.278 --> 04:41.489
More visitors without real business?

04:42.198 --> 04:43.574
Escher?!

04:53.501 --> 04:55.711
What in the world happened?!

04:55.712 --> 04:57.171
Well...

04:58.381 --> 05:00.882
You run into trouble, Escher?

05:00.883 --> 05:04.679
If it's for you,
we'll pitch in, no charge.

05:05.179 --> 05:06.431
Everyone...

05:08.641 --> 05:10.810
Don't call for help.

05:14.230 --> 05:18.358
It's all right. The Father just
slipped and fell in the rain.

05:18.359 --> 05:20.778
I was hoping he could rest a bit here.

05:21.279 --> 05:25.158
I actually need to get going, so...

05:25.950 --> 05:28.703
Please, look after him.

05:39.088 --> 05:43.843
<i>I'm so stupid. Why didn't I ask for help?</i>

05:44.552 --> 05:47.722
<i>They all looked so strong.</i>

05:51.017 --> 05:52.476
<i>That's right.</i>

05:52.477 --> 05:57.482
<i>Because I understand.
Deep down, I can tell...</i>

05:58.983 --> 06:00.860
<i>everyone would die.</i>

06:01.736 --> 06:03.446
<i>No one can stop him.</i>

06:04.322 --> 06:07.742
<i>I have to... have to figure
out some way to save him...</i>

06:08.284 --> 06:09.827
<i>or Babylon will die!</i>

06:10.703 --> 06:14.874
I was getting sick of her singing, anyway.

06:16.250 --> 06:23.006
<i>Oh, God... the only thing I'm good at is
singing and he would reject that, too?</i>

06:23.007 --> 06:24.759
<i>How can I stop him?!</i>

06:25.259 --> 06:29.012
Please! I'll offer up my own life!

06:29.013 --> 06:32.809
So, please, God!

06:33.935 --> 06:39.023
Absurd. And that's the reason
you joined the church?

06:40.983 --> 06:44.112
I'm amazed you call yourself a holy woman.

06:49.826 --> 06:53.037
That said... I don't actually disapprove.

06:53.955 --> 06:59.752
And no matter how, I get the feeling
your voice will reach the heavens,

07:01.170 --> 07:02.338
Escher...

07:06.676 --> 07:10.179
I knew it was you!
That was quite the spill, huh?

07:10.763 --> 07:14.183
It started pouring while we were
on our way to report to the guild.

07:14.475 --> 07:15.851
Hang on a sec.

07:15.852 --> 07:18.270
Sylpha and the others
are buying raincoats,

07:18.271 --> 07:19.981
and then we'll walk you
to the church.

07:23.443 --> 07:26.946
Please! You have to save Babylon!

07:30.700 --> 07:32.702
I'm sorry, I...

07:34.620 --> 07:36.956
Why would I ask you that?

07:38.583 --> 07:39.834
I'm sorry.

07:40.251 --> 07:43.463
It's nothing. Forget I said anything...

08:01.647 --> 08:03.483
Well, now you've done it.

08:07.195 --> 08:09.989
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

08:10.990 --> 08:12.866
I can't really complain.

08:12.867 --> 08:16.871
My life was pretty shitty
before I met you.

08:17.413 --> 08:20.416
And I did what I could
to help out the boss.

08:21.375 --> 08:23.461
Yeah, yeah... I'll admit it.

08:24.629 --> 08:27.423
I liked Escher's singing.

08:27.882 --> 08:29.800
I bet the boss does, too.

08:30.760 --> 08:33.471
So, y'know, I'd say it worked out.

08:34.764 --> 08:37.975
Hey, does this place
have anything to drink?

08:42.772 --> 08:46.024
Ow, ow, ow! What's your problem?!

08:46.025 --> 08:47.777
We're finally reunited
and this is what you do?

09:03.042 --> 09:06.796
I guess you're right.
We'll save the drinks for next time.

09:23.062 --> 09:26.524
I'll try and have some good stories
to share, next time I show up.

09:46.752 --> 09:48.628
Babylon's awake!

09:48.629 --> 09:50.464
- What, what is going on?!
Babylon's awake!

09:50.673 --> 09:52.465
Oh, ish shuch a welief!

09:52.466 --> 09:56.136
I'm sho gwad jou're... okay...

09:56.137 --> 09:56.971
She passed out!

09:57.263 --> 10:01.267
Uh, sorry, but could someone fill me in?

10:01.934 --> 10:03.893
Everything that happened during
the three days Babylon was...

10:03.894 --> 10:04.894
...Unconscious!

10:04.895 --> 10:08.148
Lloyd grabbed the injured Babylon and
brought him to Lordost for treatment!

10:08.149 --> 10:10.233
Three days later, Babylon wakes up.

10:10.234 --> 10:11.401
That's where we are now.

10:11.402 --> 10:14.487
And since the church might
be infiltrated again,

10:14.488 --> 10:15.989
he had someone stay and keep watch.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.782
He also had someone head
to the Adventurer's Guild

10:17.783 --> 10:19.409
to report back on what
happened to the church...

10:19.410 --> 10:20.869
And the ghoul hunt.

10:20.870 --> 10:24.039
As well as informed
Prince Albert what happened.

10:24.040 --> 10:25.415
At Castle Saloum.

10:25.416 --> 10:29.044
He also brought Escher and
the Pastor to Lordost.

10:29.045 --> 10:30.337
For their safety.

10:30.338 --> 10:32.964
In addition to having the sisters from
the church move into the castle.

10:32.965 --> 10:33.882
Also for safety.

10:33.883 --> 10:38.136
Lastly, he had the nice guy bros work on
patching up the church which brings us...

10:38.137 --> 10:39.096
To the present.

10:40.014 --> 10:41.265
I see.

10:42.141 --> 10:44.893
I get the picture,
apart from "the nice guy bros."

10:44.894 --> 10:46.312
The boss...

10:46.687 --> 10:47.896
Where's Prince Lloyd?

10:47.897 --> 10:51.816
You lucked out, Babylon.
If you hadn't woken up today...

10:51.817 --> 10:56.446
All right! Time for my forced
awakening experiments with Babylon!

10:56.447 --> 10:58.198
Forced awakening experiment?!

10:58.199 --> 11:01.493
Oh, Babylon... you're awake.

11:01.494 --> 11:02.952
What a relief.

11:02.953 --> 11:04.455
Why do you look disappointed?!

11:05.331 --> 11:08.208
I think I got off easier
than I might have because of

11:08.209 --> 11:10.710
how much I had compressed my organs
with my flexibility powers.

11:10.711 --> 11:12.796
It might've saved my life.

11:12.797 --> 11:16.967
Stupid! You were still
nearly gone for good!

11:17.343 --> 11:21.721
Lloyd and Jihriel were casting healing
magic on you for over ten hours,

11:21.722 --> 11:24.182
and you still didn't wake up!

11:24.183 --> 11:25.351
Ten hours?!

11:26.185 --> 11:28.728
I must've really worried you.

11:28.729 --> 11:31.690
You wanna thank someone,
save it for Escher and Jade.

11:32.483 --> 11:37.780
Escher was purifying you non-stop,
when you wouldn't regain consciousness.

11:38.239 --> 11:42.659
And more than that,
without her asking for my help...

11:42.660 --> 11:44.995
and if I couldn't teleport...

11:45.538 --> 11:47.832
You definitely would've died.

11:49.750 --> 11:50.835
Right.

11:51.502 --> 11:57.091
So, I have some questions about
what happened at the church.

11:58.050 --> 12:04.013
Then the enemy can shapeshift
like a monster and use Luxa?!

12:04.014 --> 12:05.265
Don't be ridiculous!

12:05.266 --> 12:10.728
You make it sound as though I
bestowed divine sorcery upon a monster!

12:10.729 --> 12:11.813
Thing is,

12:11.814 --> 12:16.068
the underground ghoul we ran into
blew itself up with divine sorcery.

12:16.360 --> 12:19.321
I... can't really explain that myself.

12:19.822 --> 12:24.826
I hit that pastor with at
least thirty shots of Glow.

12:24.827 --> 12:29.456
But there was no sign of
him turning good at all.

12:29.457 --> 12:30.666
Then that'd mean...

12:31.000 --> 12:35.004
He probably didn't feel as though
he was doing anything wrong.

12:36.672 --> 12:40.801
Purification generally has an
effect on guilty consciences.

12:41.051 --> 12:43.846
It can't create feelings that
didn't previously exist...

12:44.889 --> 12:46.222
Or maybe

12:46.223 --> 12:50.311
he has some sort of iron-clad belief that
Babylon's purification couldn't penetrate.

12:51.562 --> 12:55.399
<i>Whatever the case, he sounds like trouble.</i>

12:57.818 --> 13:03.657
He grabbed me by the throat and started
talking about increasing security...

13:04.492 --> 13:07.368
So, he wanted to have wraiths
possess the Father and Escher

13:07.369 --> 13:10.330
in order to have more eyes
in the church...

13:10.331 --> 13:12.165
But to what end?

13:12.166 --> 13:14.001
<i>He's like a detective.</i>

13:14.627 --> 13:19.005
Around what time did you encounter
the mysterious pastor, Babylon?

13:19.006 --> 13:22.091
I had been keeping an eye
on the interior garden,

13:22.092 --> 13:24.595
since that was where I
first encountered him.

13:25.054 --> 13:29.350
And when I went to check it on
the day in question, he was back.

13:29.725 --> 13:32.478
The interior garden again...

13:33.062 --> 13:34.980
<i>Come to think of it, Escher said...</i>

13:35.231 --> 13:40.610
He made it sound like my
singing always made him sick.

13:40.611 --> 13:43.364
<i>"Always", eh?</i>

13:43.656 --> 13:45.865
That inner garden is suspicious!

13:45.866 --> 13:47.492
Yeah, suspicious!

13:47.493 --> 13:48.618
So cute!

13:48.619 --> 13:50.120
The boss isn't your toy.

13:50.454 --> 13:51.872
Hey!

13:53.290 --> 13:55.458
Good work on repairing the church.

13:55.459 --> 13:56.751
Sure thing!

13:56.752 --> 13:57.627
Boss!

13:57.628 --> 13:59.295
Prince Lloyd!

13:59.296 --> 14:01.798
The inner garden looks good as new.

14:01.799 --> 14:02.549
Yep!

14:02.550 --> 14:05.051
Just gotta patch the hole in the wall.

14:05.052 --> 14:05.468
Yeah!

14:05.469 --> 14:07.720
- Have they always acted this way?
Yeah!

14:07.721 --> 14:10.139
We'll be sure to finish up

14:10.140 --> 14:15.062
before the Pope arrives for the
Great Advent Festival in three days!

14:17.147 --> 14:19.941
Good to see Babylon is doing okay, Lloyd!

14:19.942 --> 14:21.818
Hey, you're an ace detective.

14:21.819 --> 14:24.822
Yep! Thanks for keeping
an eye on things, Tao.

14:26.949 --> 14:29.576
Anything happen on your end?

14:29.577 --> 14:31.619
Not a thing!

14:31.620 --> 14:36.416
Katarina came by, though.
I filled her in on the details.

14:36.417 --> 14:38.668
And what did she have to say?

14:38.669 --> 14:40.378
That she's mortified!

14:40.379 --> 14:42.171
You're back?!

14:42.172 --> 14:45.675
Yes, and I'm reconsidering my job
with the Adventurer's Guild!

14:45.676 --> 14:48.219
What the heck happened?

14:48.220 --> 14:49.555
After what you told me...

14:50.222 --> 14:55.019
I contacted Church headquarters and
gave them the likeness of that pastor.

14:55.895 --> 15:00.441
These are from the Adventurer's
Guild and the second prince, Albert.

15:00.733 --> 15:02.902
They both concern the same matter.

15:04.361 --> 15:07.405
This man apparently attacked
the Daen district church,

15:07.406 --> 15:11.117
and they're asking if we
know who it might be.

15:11.118 --> 15:13.703
Was anyone injured?

15:13.704 --> 15:15.580
The culprit escaped, and one
of the apprentice clergy

15:15.581 --> 15:18.041
who was fighting in defense
was seriously injured.

15:18.042 --> 15:21.170
The rest of the church's staff were
taken into protective custody.

15:23.756 --> 15:26.508
And they're asking if we
know who this might be?

15:27.009 --> 15:32.890
During the attack, the man depicted in
that picture cast the divine spell, Luxa.

15:34.308 --> 15:35.558
That's absurd!

15:35.559 --> 15:40.271
Are they suggesting this madman is
one of us, God's most dedicated servants?!

15:40.272 --> 15:44.193
Who is responsible for
these profane rumors?!

15:44.860 --> 15:47.655
Likely the apprentice who
fought to defend the church.

15:48.072 --> 15:50.240
That said, he was formerly
a wanted criminal.

15:50.783 --> 15:53.660
He currently serves the
governor of Lordost island.

15:53.661 --> 15:56.245
And they believe a rogue like that?!

15:56.246 --> 15:59.332
Lordost Island is a hive of thuggery!

15:59.333 --> 16:02.044
There were rumors of a riot
there just the other day!

16:02.294 --> 16:03.671
Silence.

16:04.129 --> 16:08.174
Do not disparage others without certainty.

16:08.175 --> 16:10.635
B-But Your Holiness...

16:10.636 --> 16:14.431
They are the ones casting
aspersions on us, with no basis.

16:14.723 --> 16:18.560
That is true.
So, this will be our reply...

16:18.936 --> 16:22.438
"If you're accusing the Church,
you'd better have evidence," they said!

16:22.439 --> 16:26.318
My boss is furious with me!

16:27.903 --> 16:30.321
We just fixed that window!

16:30.322 --> 16:32.365
But I guess it's okay!

16:32.366 --> 16:34.076
They really are nice guys.

16:34.410 --> 16:38.329
The Adventurer's Guild won't be able to
do anything to help with this incident.

16:38.330 --> 16:41.833
We can't even put up wanted
posters with his likeness...

16:41.834 --> 16:43.794
I'm so sorry.

16:44.336 --> 16:46.755
Then we need that evidence!

16:47.089 --> 16:49.465
Leave no stone unturned!

16:49.466 --> 16:50.718
Aye aye, sir!

16:51.635 --> 16:54.095
But we just fixed the garden!

16:54.096 --> 16:55.763
But I guess it's okay!

16:55.764 --> 16:57.306
Maybe too nice?

16:57.307 --> 16:59.100
There's nothing nice about it!

16:59.101 --> 17:03.272
I told you, this is a sacred location
where pets have been laid to rest!

17:04.189 --> 17:07.191
Searching without making a
mess complicates things...

17:07.192 --> 17:11.739
Shiro's nose is usually pretty reliable,
but he's avoiding me for some reason.

17:12.072 --> 17:16.243
It's like he noticed something
but is pretending he didn't.

17:16.744 --> 17:17.995
Caw!

17:24.001 --> 17:25.544
Caw! Caw!

17:26.045 --> 17:27.755
Caw! Caw!

17:28.172 --> 17:30.339
I'm asking them to help us search.

17:30.340 --> 17:34.511
They've got good vision, and there's enough
of them to check anything suspicious.

17:34.887 --> 17:36.888
Nice one, Crow!

17:36.889 --> 17:40.809
Using your cursed speech to control
your namesake! You've improved.

17:41.477 --> 17:43.811
Shiro looks really conflicted.

17:43.812 --> 17:46.774
He still isn't helping, though.

17:47.066 --> 17:51.819
Come to think of it, Shiro was really
scared when he first came here.

17:51.820 --> 17:54.281
I really think there
must be something here.

17:57.076 --> 17:58.243
Saria!

17:59.411 --> 18:00.954
What are you doing here?

18:03.040 --> 18:05.084
Prince Lloyd!

18:05.501 --> 18:08.462
Listen... I...

18:10.923 --> 18:13.717
I'm so glad you're okay.

18:15.719 --> 18:16.720
Saria...!

18:18.514 --> 18:21.724
This is your punishment for ditching
practice without telling me!

18:21.725 --> 18:24.228
Incredible! She's actually
making music that way!

18:24.603 --> 18:27.481
So, are you going to be
okay for the recital?

18:30.692 --> 18:32.820
Uh, Princess Saria...

18:33.737 --> 18:37.073
Thank you for saving Escher, Pavlov.

18:37.074 --> 18:38.158
It's Babylon, actually.

18:39.118 --> 18:42.578
It's as you've heard.
Escher was attacked by some villains.

18:42.579 --> 18:45.706
She may be targeted again.

18:45.707 --> 18:49.253
Which is why it might be better
to cancel the recital.

18:52.589 --> 18:53.632
I see.

18:54.633 --> 18:58.220
I'll perform on my own, then.

19:06.562 --> 19:07.604
Guys!

19:43.765 --> 19:47.352
A basement?!
How did I not know about this?

19:47.978 --> 19:50.772
I never noticed it...

19:56.278 --> 20:02.576
<i>The door... it's made of a special
plywood that shuts out both mana and qi.</i>

20:03.827 --> 20:05.412
<i>No wonder it went unnoticed.</i>

20:05.829 --> 20:08.497
What is going on underneath the church?

20:08.498 --> 20:11.376
And what is that smell?

20:14.421 --> 20:15.839
You shouldn't see this.

20:19.885 --> 20:25.182
Of course not.
You stay here with the Pastor, Escher.

20:28.602 --> 20:31.730
Please! Let me go with you!

20:33.523 --> 20:35.691
I won't cause any trouble.

20:35.692 --> 20:37.402
That is not happening!

20:37.819 --> 20:40.655
You're being targeted-

20:40.656 --> 20:45.368
Yes, and you're injured,
so you should stay here with the Pastor.

20:45.369 --> 20:48.246
Stupid! Do you realize what you're doing?!

20:48.247 --> 20:49.789
It'll be way more dangerous down there!

20:49.790 --> 20:50.958
Come on!

20:52.251 --> 20:54.211
I don't want this to get her down.

20:55.921 --> 20:59.633
Since I'm a fan of hers, too.

21:00.467 --> 21:02.843
Since when did you two get close?

21:02.844 --> 21:04.596
While you were asleep, actually.

21:08.267 --> 21:11.186
<i>Babylon... I'm sorry.</i>

21:11.937 --> 21:15.732
<i>But if I look away now...</i>

21:16.608 --> 21:20.279
<i>I think I'll never be able to
face forward and sing again.</i>

21:21.238 --> 21:25.742
<i>I have to overcome this fear,
and make it back.</i>

21:31.290 --> 21:32.581
What's the call?

21:32.582 --> 21:35.084
Are you going? Or not?

21:35.085 --> 21:38.338
<i>I'm scared, woof. But...</i>

21:38.755 --> 21:41.883
Please! Let me go with you!

21:47.848 --> 21:50.392
Hell yeah! That's why
you're a good boy, Shiro!

21:59.651 --> 22:02.279
What blasphemy is this?!

22:03.864 --> 22:06.491
I get why Shiro was freaked out, now.

23:51.471 --> 23:54.808
<i>I was on the brink of sharing drinks
with Jade in the afterlife.</i>

23:55.183 --> 23:58.270
<i>But I made it back, thanks to her singing.</i>

23:58.812 --> 24:00.688
<i>Next time, Episode 18:</i>

24:00.689 --> 24:01.940
<i>"Escher's Will."</i>

24:02.315 --> 24:04.985
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>
